  <item>
    <title>Chill Summer Vibe夏日特辑｜小众宝藏乐队们</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66af79697349f7a557aad9aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66af79697349f7a557aad9aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Aug 2024 12:51:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh5agrMr1kWhgAUfbLOWC6HgMlpF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>转眼夏天已经过了大半</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期从夏天刚开始 第一次开空调时就开始准备的播客终于录制完成</span></p><span></span><p><span>四季里面最喜欢夏季，喜欢它独有的热烈、热情、浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span>陆陆续续收藏了许多从去年夏天就开始循环的宝藏音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们大多是知名度还不算高的乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐的夏日氛围浓厚</span></p><span></span><p><span>一下子就可以把我们带入到夏日温柔拂面的晚风里、海边的浪花里、海岛氤氲雾气的雨林里</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 bgm 🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span>ylang ylang - FKJ</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 音乐列表🎵</span></p><span></span><p><span>·我们想去的地方-白色海岸</span></p><span></span><p><span>·夏日露天电影-白色海岸</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Millions of Years Apart-恐龙的皮</span></p><span></span><p><span>·薄荷夏日-完美倒立</span></p><span></span><p><span>·今年一定带你去看海-和平饭店</span></p><span></span><p><span>·海浪-红白色乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Episode 33-she her her hers</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Bloody Mary girl-she her her hers</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Paradise... how far-椅子乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Fire Flower-Summer Salt</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Young Man-落日飞车/Hyukoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>·ifeel- ((( O ))) / FKJ</span></p><span></span><p><span>🦋播客介绍🦋</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，我是阿秋～</span></p><span></span><p><span>听音乐是我人生中最重要的精神享受，希望可以通过分享好的音乐、有能量的音乐，带给大家一些好心情！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljd9E4bn8KdrOSc-54DiNA7fWSQR.m4a" length="59454307" type="audio/mp4"/>
