  <item>
    <title>小众Jazz hiphop 慵懒·松弛·享受</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665b1f5963c334a2fba3bdb9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665b1f5963c334a2fba3bdb9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2024 13:17:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5Asc6m8bkZLj0qPbpkejCTVEa9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>说起来jazz hiphop，大家都会想到nujabes、蛋堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然我自己也是深爱着两位</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是其实还有非常多优秀的爵士嘻哈歌手</span></p><span></span><p><span>比如唾奇、路壹、国蛋、Nieve</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们因为热爱和梦想而创作&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>向大家叙述爱情、梦想、爱的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>精挑细选了这4位的一些经典歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴上耳机 或者打开音箱 一起感受jazz hiphop温柔又温暖的能量吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧bgm🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span>july - LJones</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐列表🎵</span></p><span></span><p><span>唾奇&amp;Sweet William：</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Let me</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Made my day</span></p><span></span><p><span>·走街串巷</span></p><span></span><p><span>路壹Lu1：</span></p><span></span><p><span>·焦点/highlight</span></p><span></span><p><span>·不能带你去/places</span></p><span></span><p><span>·月光/moonlight</span></p><span></span><p><span>国蛋GORDAN：</span></p><span></span><p><span>· like you</span></p><span></span><p><span>·她教我过马路</span></p><span></span><p><span>·他是个饶舌歌手</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nieve：</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Playback</span></p><span></span><p><span>·Troubles of the past</span></p><span></span><p><span>·What a dream</span></p><span></span><p><span>🦋播客介绍🦋</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，我是阿秋～</span></p><span></span><p><span>听音乐是我人生中最重要的精神享受，希望可以通过分享好的音乐、有能量的音乐，带给大家一些好心情！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljFTYb_Q2lrm07IqnFta_icJjsNk.m4a" length="52657167" type="audio/mp4"/>
